{'symbol': 'AZO', 'date': '2021-05-06 18:22:00', 'title': 'AUTOZONE TO RELEASE THIRD QUARTER EARNINGS MAY 25, 2021', 'text': "MEMPHIS, TENN., MAY 06, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AUTOZONE, INC. (NYSE:AZO), THE NATION'S LEADING AUTO PARTS RETAILER AND A LEADING DISTRIBUTOR OF AUTOMOTIVE REPLACEMENT PARTS AND ACCESSORIES, WILL RELEASE RESULTS FOR ITS THIRD QUARTER ENDED SATURDAY, MAY 8, 2021, BEFORE MARKET OPEN ON TUESDAY, MAY 25, 2021. ADDITIONALLY, THE COMPANY WILL HOST A ONE-HOUR CONFERENCE CALL ON TUESDAY, MAY 25, 2021, BEGINNING AT 10:00 A.M. (EDT), TO DISCUSS THE RESULTS OF THE QUARTER."}